<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sw">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Site Under Maintenance</title>

    <style>
        *{
            margin:0;
            padding:0;
            box-sizing:border-box;
            font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }

        body{
            background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e3a8a);
            color:#fff;
            display:flex;
            justify-content:center;
            align-items:center;
            min-height:100vh;
            text-align:center;
            padding:20px;
        }

        .container{
            max-width:650px;
            background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
            padding:50px;
            border-radius:20px;
            box-shadow:0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
        }

        h1{
            font-size:42px;
            margin-bottom:20px;
        }

        p{
            font-size:18px;
            line-height:1.7;
            color:#ddd;
        }

        .icon{
            font-size:80px;
            margin-bottom:20px;
        }

        .status{
            display:inline-block;
            margin-top:30px;
            padding:10px 25px;
            background:#f59e0b;
            color:#000;
            border-radius:30px;
            font-weight:bold;
        }

        .footer{
            margin-top:35px;
            font-size:14px;
            color:#ccc;
        }

        @media(max-width:600px){
            h1{
                font-size:30px;
            }

            p{
                font-size:16px;
            }

            .container{
                padding:30px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

    <div class="icon">🛠️</div>

    <h1>Website Under Maintenance</h1>

    <p>
        Samahani kwa usumbufu.
        Kwa sasa tunafanya maboresho kwenye mfumo ili kukupa huduma bora zaidi.
        Tafadhali rudi tena baada ya muda mfupi.
    </p>

    <div class="status">
        Maintenance in Progress
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        &copy; 2026 Your Company. All Rights Reserved.
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>